title: "AgriDatasets.jl: A Julia package for open-access agricultural and agronomic datasets"
abstract: "AgriDatasets.jl provides seamless access to a curated collection of agricultural, agronomic, soil, and animal science datasets for statistical modeling and open-science research in Julia."
